    "section": "tome-cults/data/talents/demented/void.lua",
    "source": "Reinforce your armor with countless tiny void stars, increasing armor by %d.\nEach time your void stars are fully depleted, you gain a shield absorbing the next %d damage taken within %d turns. This shield cannot trigger again until your void stars are fully restored.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "用无数微小的虚空之星强化护甲，护甲值提高 %d。\n每次虚空之星完全消耗后，生成一个吸收 %d 伤害的护盾持续 %d 回合。在虚空之星完全恢复前无法再次生成护盾。",
