    "line": 3300,
    "section": "tome-cults/data/talents/demented/void.lua",
    "source": "Consuming a void star, you use it to summon a void monolith at the targeted location for %d turns. The monolith is very durable, and while immobile it will attempt to daze enemies within radius %d for 2 turns every half a turn using your spellpower.\n\t\t\tThe monolith will gain %d life rating and %d%% all resist based on your Magic stat.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "消耗一枚虚空之星，在目标位置召唤持续 %d 回合的虚无巨石。巨石非常坚固，无法移动，每半回合对 %d 码范围内敌人施加眩晕2回合（基于本体法术强度）。\n\t\t\t基于你的魔法属性，巨石获得 %d 生命成长和 %d%% 全体抗性。",
