  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 3443,
    "section": "tome-cults/data/talents/misc/races.lua",
    "source": "Your skin grows small spikes coated in dark blight.\n\t\tWhen you are hit in melee the attacker starts bleeding black blood for 5 turns that deals %0.2f darkness damage each turn. This effect may only happen once per turn.\n\t\tYou are empowered by the sight of the black blood, for each bleeding creature in radius 2 you gain 5%% all resistances, limited to %d creatures.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with your Magic stat.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "你的皮肤生长出被黑暗和枯萎力量覆盖的尖刺。\n\t\t当你被近战攻击命中时，攻击者开始流出黑血，持续 5 回合，每回合造成 %0.2f 暗影伤害。该效果每回合只能触发一次。\n\t\t同时，目睹黑血会使你受到强化：2 格范围内每个可见的流着黑血的生物，都使你获得 5%% 全部抗性，最多计 %d 个生物。\n\t\t伤害随魔法属性提升。",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "tome-cults.lua",
    "component": "cults",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "events": [
      {
        "commit": "1bad3fe119c121f55bf4ec0ed483c9ed569624d5",
        "change": "modified",
        "fields": [
          "target"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "baseline_target": " 你的皮肤生长出被黑暗和枯萎力量覆盖的尖刺。\n\t\t当你被近战攻击命中时，攻击者开始流出黑血，持续 5 回合，每回合造成 %0.2f 暗影伤害。该效果每回合只能触发一次。\n\t\t同时，目睹黑血会使你受到强化：2 格范围内每个可见的流着黑血的生物，都使你获得 5%% 全部抗性，最多计 %d 个生物。\n\t\t伤害随魔法属性提升。",
    "net_changed": true,
