  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 3458,
    "section": "tome-cults/data/talents/misc/races.lua",
    "source": "Your affinity with things that dwell deep beneath the surface allows you to summon a hungering mouth.\n\t\tThe mouth has %d bonus life, lasts for %d turns, and deals no damage.\n\t\tEach turn the mouth will draw all enemies in radius 10 2 spaces towards itself.\n\t\tIts bonus life depends on your Constitution stat and talent level.  Many other stats will scale with level.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "你同地下深处某物的联系让你能召唤一只饥饿巨口。\n\t\t每回合它将周围 10 码内所有敌人朝自身拉近 2 码。\n\t\t它有 %d 额外生命，存在 %d 回合，不造成伤害。\n\t\t它的额外生命取决于你的体质和技能等级。许多其他属性受等级影响。",
    "args_order": null,
    "special": null,
    "logical_path": "tome-cults.lua",
    "component": "cults",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "events": [
      {
