  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 3470,
    "section": "tome-cults/data/talents/misc/races.lua",
    "source": "You unleash the wrath of the wilds for 5 turns.\n\t\tWhen you deal damage to a creature while wrath is active you have %d%% chance (100%% for the first creature hit each turn) to stun them for 3 turns.\n\t\tThis effect can only stun a creature once per turn.\n\t\tChance scales with your Constitution and apply power is the highest or your physical or mind power.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "你释放持续 5 回合的自然的愤怒。\n\t\t愤怒状态下，每当你造成伤害时有 %d%% （每回合攻击的第一个生物 100%%）几率震慑 3 回合。\n\t\t每个敌人每回合只能被该技能震慑一次。\n\t\t震慑几率受体质影响，强度由物理或精神强度中较高一项决定。",
    "args_order": null,
