  {
    "function_name": "t",
    "kind": "translation",
    "line": 3510,
    "section": "tome-cults/data/talents/misc/races.lua",
    "source": "You were created by ziguranth for one purpose only, to wage war on magic!\n\t\t\tStrike your target dealing %d%% %s weapon damage and silencing them for %d turns.\n\t\t\tThe damage type will change with your drake aspect.\n\t\t\tThe chance to silence will increase with the highest of your physical or mind power.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "target": "你被伊格制造的唯一理由：对魔法作战！\n\t\t打击你的敌人，造成 %d%% %s 武器伤害，并沉默它们 %d 回合。\n\t\t伤害类型根据龙血的类型而决定。\n\t\t沉默的几率受物理强度或精神强度的最高值加成。",
